# Scratch folder where files delivered from chat sessions land. It has held
# stale duplicates of tests/*.py, which pytest then collected alongside the
# real ones and refused with "import file mismatch" (see pyproject.toml's
# testpaths setting, added after that same incident).
Claude outputs/

# Stage-4 patch-generation run outputs. These are regenerated by
# scripts/generate_stage4_patches.py, and reports/**/*.jsonl is LFS-tracked,
# so committing exploratory smoke runs spends LFS storage on results the next
# run supersedes. Force-add a specific file (git add -f) when a run is a
# result worth keeping.
reports/fault_localization/stage4_patch_generation_dev_v1/

